OL,4,CBabydoll singer Jamie Miller covers    
OL,5,CChristmas classic                      
OL,6,GAfter spending four weeks at number    
OL,7,Gone in the UK singles charts, Jamie    
OL,8,GMiller is releasing his take on the    
OL,9,Gfestive classic It's Beginning To Look 
OL,10,GA Lot Like Christmas.                  
OL,12,FIn October, Miller became the first    
OL,13,Fartist from Wales to top the UK        
OL,14,Fsingles chart since 2011 with his      
OL,15,FTikTok-viral song Babydoll.            
OL,17,FThe success transformed Miller's       
OL,18,Fcareer, but he revealed that his "made 
OL,19,Fit" moment was telling his taxi driver 
OL,20,Fdad and cleaner mum they could retire. 
